From k176 (2026-11-09). list_sessions, list_projects and _runs sort on the time strings (last_activity, started_at). That is right for the UTC millisecond times Claude Code writes, but wrong when formats mix within a second ("…:00.500Z" sorts older than "…:00Z") or a time carries an offset. Not a live bug, since Claude Code writes one format; it bites only on hand-written or foreign files. Done when sorting goes through _iso_ms (k176) with string order as tie-break, or the card is closed as not worth it. Lane: mcp-hub-worker.

